update camdecmps.EMISSION_EVALUATION set Submission_Comment = 'I certify that the automated Data Acquisition and Handling System (DAHS) component of each CEM system was tested and that proper computation of hourly averages for SO2, NOx, CO2, and heat input rate for each formula submitted in the monitoring plan, according to the requirements of 40 CFR Part 75, was verified.

I certify that the automated Data Acquisition and Handling System (DAHS) component of each CEM system was tested and that proper computation of the missing data substitution procedures was verified according to 40 CFR Part 75.

