update camdecmps.EMISSION_EVALUATION set Submission_Comment = 'Gas Cylinder ID CC266691 was previously reported as Gas Cylinder ID CC26691 in the QA and Certification Data files submitted for the 3rd and 4th quarter 2011.

Gas cylinder ID XC021340B has a certified value of 55.35 ppm NOx. Due to a DAHS rounding error, a reference value of 55.3 has been reported for 3rd and 4th quarter 2011 linearity tests for Components N04 and N05, as well as daily calibration error tests, for the period starting on 12/21/2011 through 12/31/2011. We now believe a reference value of 55.4 ppm should have been reported instead. A review of all tests in question for 3rd and 4th quarter 2011, as well as 1st quarter 2012, using a reference value of 55.4 ppm, indicates there would be no change in QA status for either component due to the rounding error. Therefore, we do not plan to resubmit those electronic data reports, unless contacted by EPA and requested to do so.
