update camdecmps.EMISSION_EVALUATION set Submission_Comment = '2nd Quarter 2012 Emissions Data Qualification for Thetford Unit 4 (ORIS 1719)

Thetford Unit 4 employs the Low Mass Emissions (LME) Unit methodology of 40 CFR 75.19, including the use of a long term fuel flow monitoring system.  As part of this monitoring method, Consumers Energy employs a proprietary Microsoft Excel program called DataLink? which serves as a datalogger and collects information regarding unit operation and fuel usage.  The DataLink? information for the second quarter of 2012 indicates that Unit 4 did not operate during the quarter.  However, other internal sources of information available at Consumers Energy indicates that Unit 4 may have operated for 15 hours during the quarter.  After conducting an investigation, Consumers Energy has concluded that Unit 4 did operate during the 2nd quarter of 2012, but the DataLink? program did not collect any unit operating or fuel flow data.  Therefore, we are submitting a revised EDR reflecting Unit 4 operation consistent with internal Consumers Energy information sources, and the heat input for each operating hour has been estimated based upon the maximum rated heat input capacity for the unit. 
' where Mon_Plan_Id = 'MDC-33AA6C658CFC490B884001903F0AA458' and Rpt_Period_Id = 78 and coalesce( Submission_Id, 0 ) <= 0;
