update camdecmps.EMISSION_EVALUATION set Submission_Comment = 'The ""INFROM HOUROP-44B"" error annunciated when ECMPS made a last minute change to the QA/QC checks which left the DAHS vendor unable to get the updated software published to all facilities. Our vendor has corrected for this QA/QC check. Since this is currently an inform type error, the software patch will be installed after the 2017Q2 reports are complete. SFinley 07/24/17' where Mon_Plan_Id = 'MDC-3F39A4A0C0754BCB91E90A307E3A6B9F' and Rpt_Period_Id = 98 and coalesce( Submission_Id, 0 ) <= 0;
update camdecmps.EMISSION_EVALUATION set Submission_Comment = 'Designated Representative Certification Statement

DR:   C. D.  HOLLEY 

Part 75, CERTIFY CONTROLLED
I certify that all data submitted in this report were recorded in accordance with the applicable requirements of 40 CFR Part 75, and that all emissions and quality control data are reported using component ID codes, system ID codes, and formula ID codes which represent current operating conditions. 
I certify that for all hours in which data are submitted following the provisions of 75.34(a)(a) that the add-on emission controls were operating within the range of parameters listed in the monitoring plan and that the substitute values recorded during the quarter do not systematically underestimate SO2 or other emissions, pursuant to ? 75.34. 

Additional Information: 
Altavista is burning wood dust in additions to coal.  For the 2nd qtr 2006 CAMD provided Dominion guidance to use and Fc during the wood dust test burns.  The site is out of the test burn approved phase and is currently using an Fc of 1806 for wood dust/coal burn periods.  This Fc was proposed in a petition submitted to EPA CAMD on September 20, 2006.  CAMD approved the petition on February 13, 2007. The site only burns wood dust in combination with coal.     
         
Exception Statement:
The statements above are accurate except in instances where monitoring plan and QA events could not be accurately represented with the ECMPS checks.

' where Mon_Plan_Id = 'MDC-3FCE7C2C8DEC4BA3867596AAAF95396C' and Rpt_Period_Id = 65 and coalesce( Submission_Id, 0 ) <= 0;
update camdecmps.EMISSION_EVALUATION set Submission_Comment = 'Designated Representative Certification Statement

DR:   C. D.  HOLLEY 

Part 75, CERTIFY CONTROLLED
I certify that all data submitted in this report were recorded in accordance with the applicable requirements of 40 CFR Part 75, and that all emissions and quality control data are reported using component ID codes, system ID codes, and formula ID codes which represent current operating conditions. 
