update camdecmps.EMISSION_EVALUATION set Submission_Comment = 'For all hours in which Unit 003 NOx data are substituted, I certify that the add-on emission controls (i.e., selective catalytic reduction, or SCR) were operating properly and that the substitute values recorded during the quarter do not systematically underestimate emissions.

The Q4-2023 EDR for Unit 003 contains numerous natural gas Gross Calorific Value (GCV) Sample Type Codes that are not accurate.  We attempted to work with the data acquisition and handling system vendor (ESC Spectrum) to correct the sample type codes but were unable to reach a timely resolution.  Specifically, the EDR reflects a GCV Sample Type Code of 06 [Highest Sampled Value in Previous Calendar Year (or a higher sampled value, superseding the assumed value)] for the following periods:  10/01/23, Hr 00 - 10/10/23, Hr 07; 10/13/23, Hr 09 - 10/20/23, Hr 08; and 10/20/23, Hr 13 - 12/31/23, Hr 23.  The EDR should reflect GCV Sample Type Code 00 [Actual measured hourly average sample from GCH] for the following periods: 10/01/23, Hr 09 - 10/10/23, Hr 07; 10/31/23, Hr 11 - 12/05/23, Hr 08; and 12/21/23, Hr 11 - 12/31/23, Hr 23 and GCV Sample Type Code 02 [Actual Measured Value from a Daily Sample] for the following periods:  10/13/23, Hr 09 - 10/20/23, Hr 08; 10/20/13, Hr 13 - 10/28/23, Hr 00 and 12/05/23, Hr 09 - 12/21/23, Hr 10.' where Mon_Plan_Id = 'MDC-96976D38DF3C478DA423DDB340EF9F62' and Rpt_Period_Id = 124 and coalesce( Submission_Id, 0 ) <= 0;
