update camdecmps.EMISSION_EVALUATION set Submission_Comment = 'Designated Representative Certification Statements

DR:   Diane G. Leopold 

Part 75, CERTIFY 
I certify that all data submitted in this report were recorded in accordance with the applicable requirements of 40 CFR Part 75, and that all emissions and quality control data are reported using component ID codes, system ID codes, and formula ID codes which represent current operating conditions. 

RGGI:  Massachusetts
As the authorized account representative, I hereby certify, based on reasonable inquiry of those persons with primary responsibility for ensuring that all of the units? emissions are correctly and fully monitored, that the monitoring data contained herein were recorded in accordance with the applicable requirements of 310 CMR 7.70(8) and 40 CFR Part 75, including the quality assurance procedures and specifications;  for a unit with add-on CO2 emissions controls* and for all hours where data are substituted in accordance with 40 CFR 75.34(a)(1) , the add-on emissions controls were operating within the range of parameters listed in the quality assurance/quality control program under appendix B of 40 CFR Part 75 and the substitute values do not systematically underestimate CO2 emissions; and, the CO2 concentration values substituted for missing data under Subpart D of 40 CFR Part 75 do not systematically underestimate CO2 emissions.
 
*Note the reporting units are not equipped with add on CO2 emission controls.

Exception Statement:
The statements above are accurate except in instances where monitoring plan and QA events could not be accurately represented with the ECMPS checks.
